# slug: ch79-compose
# source: chapters/ch79.tex:68
# label: alg:ch79-compose
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch79.tex:71
# caption: Construct reachable composition when intermediate labels contain no epsilon.

REQUIRE transducers T,U with nonempty intermediate labels and finite graphs
ENSURE reachable product implementing relational composition
enqueue initial state pairs; mark them discovered
WHILE a discovered pair (p,q) remains unexpanded DO
  FORALL T arcs (p,a,b,p') and U arcs (q,b,c,q') DO
    emit arc from (p,q) to (p',q') with input a and output c
    discover and enqueue (p',q') if new
  END FOR
  mark pair final exactly when both component states are final
END WHILE

